OL,3,GNEWSARenfrew Bridge to close 'for
OL,4,Amonths' after Storm Boelo damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bridge links Renfrew with Yoker and
OL,7,FClydebank on the north bank of the
OL,8,FRiver Clyde, and is a route often used
OL,9,Fto reach the Queen Elizabeth University
OL,10,FHospital.
OL,12,FThe council said it is legally
OL,13,Fobligated to keep the Clyde open to
OL,14,Friver traffic, meaning the swing bridge
OL,15,Fwill now remain in an open position.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
